---
description: Production-grade project setup and quality retrofit workflows
alwaysApply: false
---

This repository provides two workflows for holding a codebase to production
standards. Both are plain Markdown and work with any agent.

- **New project** → read `skills/project_setup/SKILL.md`
- **Existing codebase** → read `skills/quality_retrofit/SKILL.md`

Read the whole file before acting. Both open with a mandatory read-only scan
(`scripts/detect-stack.ps1` on PowerShell or `scripts/detect-stack.sh` on
POSIX) that must run before anything is created or changed.

Paths inside those files use `${SKILL_ROOT}/...` as a placeholder. On
PowerShell, resolve with:

```powershell
$SkillRoot = & '.\scripts\skill-root.ps1'
```

On POSIX, resolve with:

```bash
SKILL_ROOT="$(bash scripts/skill-root.sh)"
```

Full detail, including the non-negotiable rules, is in `AGENTS.md` at the
repository root.
